{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 485,
    "dDurationMs": 1555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark Russinovich:\nLet's try that again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2040,
    "dDurationMs": 1027,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good morning, everybody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3092,
    "dDurationMs": 1198,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All: Good morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4290,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark Russinovich:\nHow's Build going?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5790,
    "dDurationMs": 1071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good?\n[ Cheers ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6873,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, welcome to\nInside Azure Innovations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11058,
    "dDurationMs": 1152,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My name is Mark Russinovich."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12210,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm the CTO and\nDeputy CISO for Azure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14670,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many people have been\nto a previous innovations talk?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17915,
    "dDurationMs": 1195,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, quite a few of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19110,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's great to see you back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20820,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For those of you that\nhaven't come, this is a talk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23910,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where I cover innovations across\nthe spectrum of everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29670,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the Azure infrastructure,\nfrom data centers all the way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32820,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to cybersecurity and the\ncyber systems that we've got"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36450,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under development in Azure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38070,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the notes that\nI make about this is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40800,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I'm showing you\nthings, in some cases,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43290,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that haven't shipped yet, some\nthings that we're working on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45750,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some things that\nmaybe have just shipped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47640,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For things that haven't shipped,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49140,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they might not necessarily ever\nship or ship in the same kind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53010,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of view that you see\nme present them at."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55175,
    "dDurationMs": 1486,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's just a\ncaveat and takeaway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56686,
    "dDurationMs": 3074,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I thought it's fun to give\nyou an under-the-hood look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59760,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at what we're doing and\nwhat powers the infrastructure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62910,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Azure and Azure innovation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64410,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's start with\ninfrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66180,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you've seen these pictures\nof the Fairwater data centers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72120,
    "dDurationMs": 1703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this kind of\nsets a framework"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73848,
    "dDurationMs": 2157,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a lot of the innovation that\nI'm going to be showing here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76029,
    "dDurationMs": 4491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is innovation powering\nAI, specifically the co-design"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80520,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of AI data centers, the core\ninfrastructure, and the software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83820,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that runs on top of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85410,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had a really awesome\nexperience in November."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88260,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got to go visit\nFairwater in Atlanta."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90870,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are Fairwater in\nWisconsin, Fairwater in Atlanta."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93420,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Atlanta site\nis on the right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95760,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I got to go in to it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97650,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I thought I'd show\nyou a quick video tour of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100500,
    "dDurationMs": 2986,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just a few seconds of\nme walking through it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103511,
    "dDurationMs": 1519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I don't know\nwhy that didn't play."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105030,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe I need to hit\nthe play button up here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110790,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is me looking like\nBuilder Bob walking through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113340,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because it's\nunder construction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115230,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of continuously\nunder construction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117240,
    "dDurationMs": 3436,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the network cabling\nthat connects the top floor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120701,
    "dDurationMs": 1969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "servers and the bottom\nfloor servers that goes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122670,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up through trunks\nthere, you can see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124980,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's enough cabling to\nwrap the earth four times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127290,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in one of these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128580,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those are liquid cooling cables\nbeing laid there initially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133290,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that servers\ncan be dropped in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135240,
    "dDurationMs": 1985,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see, we got\nto see one of these servers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137249,
    "dDurationMs": 1651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the sled being racked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138900,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the\ncables on the back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140250,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the InfiniBand and\nEthernet cables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142590,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you can see this is a\nbrake fix that we got to watch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145200,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the liquid cooling\ninto the back of the racks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147780,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I saw this on the tour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The group had gone ahead of me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151440,
    "dDurationMs": 3207,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I saw a plug and\nI plugged it in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154672,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Laughter ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156277,
    "dDurationMs": 1392,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's like, what's this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157694,
    "dDurationMs": 1258,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Shouldn't be hanging like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158977,
    "dDurationMs": 2723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Scott Guthrie got a text\nliterally a few minutes later"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161700,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "saying it looks like we've\nalready powered on Power Cell 3."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166050,
    "dDurationMs": 2096,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We didn't expect that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168171,
    "dDurationMs": 1059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to take credit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169230,
    "dDurationMs": 2476,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I thought maybe I\nbest shouldn't for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171730,
    "dDurationMs": 1947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Laughter ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173702,
    "dDurationMs": 2008,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But inside the data\ncenters themselves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175710,
    "dDurationMs": 1284,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've got the\nservers, of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177019,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of the innovations\nthat we've been developing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179077,
    "dDurationMs": 2003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in our servers is something\ncalled Azure Boost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181080,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Azure Boost is aimed\nat offloading a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184080,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the processing of the\ndata paths for storage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188850,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and networking off\nthe main server CPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192360,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it does this\nwith an offload card."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194790,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We move the data planes\noff onto that offload card."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198450,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We power them with DPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200550,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've got cores\non there as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202860,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we put our agent tree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204180,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we get the agents\noff the server as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206670,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this lets the workload\nhave most of the control"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209790,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over what's going\non on the server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212850,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This Azure Boost\ncard looks like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214500,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the latest generation\nof Azure Boost card"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216570,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we've started to\ndeploy in our data centers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218465,
    "dDurationMs": 3115,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's an actual\nversion of it right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221580,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what you can see there,\nthere's little black squares"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224130,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the middle are D-RAM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226380,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the middle\nis where the SOC is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228420,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's where the ARM cores and\nthe DPU and FPGA are located."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233010,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's where the data plane gets\nprocessed and the agents run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237210,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now some of the stats for Azure\nBoost are pretty staggering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240510,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see here,\njust in last year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243810,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since the previous generation\nof Azure Boost that I showed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246300,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at last Build, we've gone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249120,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 20 gigabytes per\nsecond of remote storage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251700,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's an increase,\nyou can see there, of 1.4."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255540,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've gone to 1 million\nIOPS for remote storage,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258570,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and on local storage,\n36 gigabytes per second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261060,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is to local NVMe,\nand 6.6 million IOPS"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265280,
    "dDurationMs": 3944,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through Azure Boost NVMe\noffload storage acceleration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269248,
    "dDurationMs": 1102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then for networking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270350,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've gone to 400 gigabits\nfrom 200 gigabits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273260,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So those were two network ports\nthat you saw there on the card,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276620,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "200 gigabits each, and 400k\nconnections per second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280350,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it supports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281910,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those two ports\nmean that they can go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284190,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to two top-of-rack router\nswitches, so that means"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286710,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can service top-of-rack\nrouters, or if one fails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290370,
    "dDurationMs": 2005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we don't lose complete\nconnectivity to the server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292400,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it also means"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293460,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sub-second servicing is\npossible now on those tours"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297570,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with sub-second impact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299220,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the workloads\nrunning on those servers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301470,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've been deploying\nthis for several years now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303690,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're over 30% of the fleet\nis now Azure Boost enabled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307260,
    "dDurationMs": 2102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every single server\ngets an Azure Boost in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309387,
    "dDurationMs": 2463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then one of the cool\ninnovations that I'll show you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311850,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a little bit is\nthat we support"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313865,
    "dDurationMs": 2155,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "guest virtual machine RDMA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316020,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is basically memory\nto memory transfers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319080,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bypassing the networking stacks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321270,
    "dDurationMs": 4346,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because Azure Boost is\nfacilitating that transport."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325640,
    "dDurationMs": 1030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326670,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I mentioned is we get the\nmanagement services off the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329220,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "server, and we put them\non the Azure Boost card."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333420,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that lets us have\nBare Metal instances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336900,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've introduced\nBare Metal instances"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339180,
    "dDurationMs": 3083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to unlimited access,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342275,
    "dDurationMs": 1856,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "specifically for OpenAI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344143,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and OpenAI's use of\nthat Fairwater data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346110,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the servers in the data\ncenter, the GPU servers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349560,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are Bare Metal instances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350790,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I thought I'd show\nyou just a quick demo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352890,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Bare Metal instances,\nwhich are going to be coming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355200,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a general purpose offering\nsometime in the near future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358710,
    "dDurationMs": 5730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here, you can see we've got\na metal instance, ND144 v6."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364440,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see here we're\ngoing to get the IP address,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366810,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we're going to SSH\ninto it and actually see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369660,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it is a Bare Metal server,\nbecause we're going to look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373320,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see if virtualization\nservices are running,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377250,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379050,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we're going to look\nat the PCI bus using LSPCI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383670,
    "dDurationMs": 2411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see we\nget lots of devices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386106,
    "dDurationMs": 1464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to\nscroll to the top,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387570,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can see\nthere's a PCI bridge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389790,
    "dDurationMs": 2427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you can see the\neight Ethernet controllers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392242,
    "dDurationMs": 1328,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are connected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393570,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the Mellanox\nRDMA-capable network adapters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399150,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are attached to that\nfor the backend network"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401700,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that those GPUs talk\nthrough to each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405360,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what do they talk?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406770,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What transport do they talk?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408300,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We switched to Ethernet\nfrom InfiniBand, actually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411330,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in those Fairwater data centers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413280,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And instead of using RoCE, which\nis RDMA over converged Ethernet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418170,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've developed, with OpenAI\nand now a growing consortium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421710,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of partners that are\ncollaborating with us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423840,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a new networking protocol called\nMultipath Reliable Connection,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427470,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or MRC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429060,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason that we developed\nMRC is that when you talk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431940,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about connecting\n100,000 GPUs together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436290,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's an incredible\namount of network fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439830,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that those packets are going\nacross from all of those GPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443220,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have any\ncongestion or any failure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446190,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a synchronous training\njob of that size, you're going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449610,
    "dDurationMs": 1695,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to lose a ton of work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451330,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're going to have to\ngo back to a checkpoint,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453390,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "restart the training job\nfrom where it left off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456660,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So MRC is designed\nto be resilient in the face"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459450,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these congestion\nissues or failures"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461280,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it sprays the packets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463680,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across independent network\ndomains called planes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467700,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore, when\na link gets dropped,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472140,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the spraying just happens\nand rebalances to the planes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474780,
    "dDurationMs": 1406,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that remain available."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476211,
    "dDurationMs": 1749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'll show you a\nquick demo of that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477960,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in action by showing you here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484530,
    "dDurationMs": 5010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we're going to see is that\nI've got two servers talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489540,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to each other over\nfour switches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491940,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're sending 4 gigabyte\npayloads to each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497130,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These 4 gigabytes are going to\nbe packet sprayed across these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501570,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see we're getting\nroughly 95 gigabytes per second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505830,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's because\nwe're spraying these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507480,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across eight planes\nwith 12 gigabits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510270,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that comes out to\n12 gigabytes per plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513660,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the aggregate\nbandwidth that we're seeing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516600,
    "dDurationMs": 2476,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is 95 gigabytes\nper second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519101,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what we're going\nto watch, because we want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520986,
    "dDurationMs": 6174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to maintain 95 gigabits per\nsecond there, which is our goal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527160,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We see four switches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528534,
    "dDurationMs": 2428,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see how much bandwidth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530987,
    "dDurationMs": 1404,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is being spread\nacross the switches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532416,
    "dDurationMs": 2424,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's actually two switches\nat this bandwidth here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534840,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you don't see, so\nthis is 12, two 24s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537720,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and one 36, adding up to 95."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540570,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now we're going to\ngo kill one of those switches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543150,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to drop it\noff of the sending server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547260,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what it's going to do is\nnow rebalance the spraying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550530,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across the remaining\nthree switches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553290,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And our goal is to not see any\ndrop in network bandwidth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556530,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, of course, that's\nexactly what we get."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558780,
    "dDurationMs": 3376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see 95-ish\ngigabits per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562180,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if we go take a look at\nthe traffic over the switches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564570,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see that one\nof them went to zero,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567330,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the other one went\nup to 36 gigabits per second"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570540,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to compensate for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571890,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So MRC is what allows us to run\nthese massive training jobs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576510,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and has now become\nthe industry standard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578820,
    "dDurationMs": 3858,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for large network topologies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584680,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I mentioned\nRDMA a few times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588540,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I was showing you was\nMRC, which is what Open AI uses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594480,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for their training jobs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596160,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're doing RDMA, of\ncourse, between the servers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599190,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in those training jobs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600570,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what we want to introduce is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602520,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to more general-purpose\nworkloads RDMA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605390,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through virtual machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606950,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now when you talk between\none VM and another VM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611390,
    "dDurationMs": 3356,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through Azure Boost, they\ncould be on different servers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614771,
    "dDurationMs": 2035,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're going through\nthese networking stacks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616830,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The application talks to TCP/IP,\nwhich talks to our MANA driver,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620760,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Microsoft Accelerated\nNetwork Adapter driver,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623460,
    "dDurationMs": 2964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the Azure Boost\nnetwork adapter driver,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626449,
    "dDurationMs": 1451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it goes back up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627900,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's a lot of memory\ncopy operations and a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630780,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of synchronization\nhappening through that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633120,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With RDMA, you bypass all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635690,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the application maps memories\nbasically in the remote system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640220,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can drop data right into its\nown local presentation of that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645560,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Azure Boost takes care\nof sending that and dropping it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648710,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the memory on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650460,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this completely eliminates\na lot of that synchronization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653970,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well as the memory copies\nand all that software path"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657900,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you get through\nthose networking stack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660540,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm going to show you\na demo of virtual machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664410,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to virtual machine\nRDMA over Azure Boost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667020,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The scenario here is\ncommon in AI workloads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670650,
    "dDurationMs": 1713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you're doing inference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672388,
    "dDurationMs": 2407,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And inference, you can\nbreak up into two parts:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674807,
    "dDurationMs": 2203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prefill and decode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677010,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Prefill is taking your prompt\nand then getting the tokens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681630,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from that prompt and\nthe KV cache populated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684150,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from that prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685230,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then decode starts to\ngenerate new tokens based off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687960,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of that system of that prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690750,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's efficient and now\ncommon to split those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694080,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into different server pools,\nso one pool for prefill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697320,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one pool for decode, because\nthey both have different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700380,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "constraints when it comes\nto memory and compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703980,
    "dDurationMs": 2947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here, we're going\nto start this demo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706939,
    "dDurationMs": 6166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of... RDMA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713130,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So first, we're going to\nlook at the performance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715350,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the TCP/IP stack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716790,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here's the pre-filler\nserver using TCP/IP."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721050,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's the decoder server,\nalso using TCP/IP,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724980,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way we're launching it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727050,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we're going to go\nrun this vLLM benchmark"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729720,
    "dDurationMs": 6190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that does this prefill decode\nload between those two servers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737250,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we're going to go\ntake a look at our RDMA stats,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739740,
    "dDurationMs": 1212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is in the bottom right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740977,
    "dDurationMs": 1823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you're going to see\nthat they don't change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742800,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as this workload runs,\nthere's 460 send requests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745440,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just keep your eye on that one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747900,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then if you take a\nlook at the performance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750660,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the token throughput, which\nis what we really want,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753120,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is about 3,400."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754770,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The median time to first token,\nwhich is another important stat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757860,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for inference, is 123,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761580,
    "dDurationMs": 5370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we switch over to RDMA\nand use the MANA link for that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766950,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see there's the F1\nVerbs Device Name as MANA 0."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771570,
    "dDurationMs": 5790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We do the same thing on\nthe decode server, MANA 0."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777360,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then let's go take a look at\nthe stats, and you can see 460,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780630,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this is going to change now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782250,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we're\nrunning the RDMA test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784260,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it changed to 506 because\nwe've sent a whole lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786480,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of packets now over to RDMA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788670,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we've almost\ndoubled the throughput to 7637."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792810,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you can see our mean\ntime to first token has dropped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796470,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to just 47,000 milliseconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799470,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's the performance\nbenefit of RDMA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802440,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we're deploying and using"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804210,
    "dDurationMs": 5490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in our inference clusters behind\nFoundry, powered by Azure Boost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809700,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so let's take a\nlook at our core now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812130,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's kind of Fairwater\ninfrastructure and some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814800,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the networking behind it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816600,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's go take a\nlook at the core."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818580,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is one of the sections\nthat I get very excited about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821700,
    "dDurationMs": 2705,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the future\nis serverless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824430,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I've been saying\nthis for a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826170,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you've come to previous\nInside Azure Innovation talks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830025,
    "dDurationMs": 1305,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even going back 10 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831330,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've been saying\nserverless is the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833004,
    "dDurationMs": 4446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, serverless as the\nfuture is really arriving now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837450,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with Azure Container Instances,\nwhich Azure Container instances,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840840,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the idea here is\nthat we've got --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843780,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "typically, when it\ncomes to containers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845310,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you think about containers\nthe way they started,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847329,
    "dDurationMs": 2038,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is process\nisolated containers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849392,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they're using the operating\nsystem primitives to try"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851637,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to keep them separate\nfrom each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853470,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's a problem with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855240,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don't consider a process\nor user mode kernel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859530,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a security boundary in Azure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861420,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We only consider virtualization\nwith a very tight connection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865530,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between -- small connection\nbetween the server and the host"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871650,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be a security\nboundary in Azure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873630,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with Azure\nContainer Instances,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875370,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we isolate those\ncontainers with Hyper-V."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879180,
    "dDurationMs": 3518,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is nested\nhypervisor here inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882723,
    "dDurationMs": 2457,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a virtual machine with\nthe containers on them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885205,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the things I'm going\nto show you in a little bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887409,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is where we're going with this,\nwhich is direct virtualization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889980,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'll save a\ndescription of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892140,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what I want to show you is\nwe're making a ton of progress"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895290,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in adopting Azure Container\nInstances throughout all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898110,
    "dDurationMs": 2739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of not just Azure,\nbut Microsoft services."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900874,
    "dDurationMs": 2096,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure that if you\ntake a look at this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902970,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see some service\nthat you've been using,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904994,
    "dDurationMs": 2538,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means you're indirectly\nusing Azure Container Instances,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907557,
    "dDurationMs": 3183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether, for example, GitHub\nActions is now running"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910740,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on Azure Container Instances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912420,
    "dDurationMs": 2217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see Python and Excel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914662,
    "dDurationMs": 1448,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "running on Azure\nContainer Instances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916110,
    "dDurationMs": 2428,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Horizon DB, which you might\nhave gone to sessions about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918563,
    "dDurationMs": 4237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here at Build, running on\nAzure Container Instances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922800,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one of the things that\nwe've been doing is trying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925530,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make Container\nInstances more efficient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928320,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also support more\nscenarios and make it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931410,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that you never need\nto do process isolation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934500,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of those is taking out\nthe virtualization overhead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937920,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is what we call\ndirect virtualization,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940080,
    "dDurationMs": 5610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is putting the containers\nright on the servers as peers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945690,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the management's\nvirtual machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948510,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We call this the\nparent partition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950250,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or Layer 1 virtualization host."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952980,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And these are Layer 2\nvirtualization hosts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955680,
    "dDurationMs": 3399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or child VMs, that\nare simply hosting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959091,
    "dDurationMs": 3219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "individual containers, or pods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962310,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this gives us that strong\nhostile multi-tenant isolation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966180,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for container instances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968790,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now one of the other Azure\nContainer Instances of cells now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973350,
    "dDurationMs": 5790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "runs on top of 01 virtualization\nor direct virtualization,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979140,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we're migrating\nour entire fleet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981660,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over to direct virtualization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983760,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This will probably\ntake a year or two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985380,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to migrate the whole fleet, but\nthis is something that is going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988800,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to give us a lot of performance\nand efficiency benefits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992790,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we want to make\ncontainers have all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996300,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the same capabilities\nof virtual machines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998940,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all of the same abilities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000110,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to attach network devices\nand storage devices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003410,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the benefits you get\nout of a virtual machine today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006440,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on any hyperscaler, including\nAzure, is minimal downtime"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010160,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the server\nneeds to be serviced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012650,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the server is\ngoing unhealthy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014900,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we recognize\nthat ahead of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016940,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is with live migration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019640,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's been missing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020900,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with containers is\nsupport for live migration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023330,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I want to show you\nthe first public demo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026240,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Container Live\nMigration in Azure here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029330,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we can take a bunch\nof containers and move them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032540,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from one server over\nto another server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040700,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here I've got a\ncontainer that's running"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044300,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on one pool of servers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047750,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here's another\npool of servers over here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050090,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we're going\nto migrate it to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051830,
    "dDurationMs": 3306,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is our live migration\nfor container instances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055161,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see this is\nstill under development,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056990,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why we're using\nthese command lines here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061100,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've got this running over\non Dev Box 6, Server Dev 6."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065950,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've got this container\nworkload, it's simply spitting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069400,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out a tick every second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071080,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see we're\nup to Tick 695."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073150,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the migration\nnow has kicked in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075476,
    "dDurationMs": 2314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that container is no\nlonger running on that server,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077820,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why that stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080180,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now if we go over and take\na look at the other server,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084920,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's migrated to, Dev 1,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087020,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we look at\nwhat's running in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088580,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that there's\nour Hello World there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091760,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if we go take a look at\nwhat's running inside of that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095180,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see there is the file"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097850,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it's been dropping\nthose ticks into."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099800,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're already way way up to 755."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101990,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's go take a look and make\nsure that 695 was in there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105470,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we didn't have\nany kind of gap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108110,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're going to go to\na CAT, scroll back up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113240,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there it is,\n695 right there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117020,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So no gap at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119420,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So container live migrating from\none server to another on top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123680,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Azure Container Instance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124820,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the way, feel free\nto clap at any time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126520,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Applause ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130924,
    "dDurationMs": 1096,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132020,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's switch over to\ntalking a little bit about AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134930,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know that there's AI fatigue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136460,
    "dDurationMs": 1698,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think we're doing some\ncool stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138170,
    "dDurationMs": 1629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with AI that I'd like\nto share with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139824,
    "dDurationMs": 3686,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of those is talking a\nlittle bit about what powers all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143510,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Microsoft's own\ninference and own training,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146120,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's a system\ncalled Manifold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149120,
    "dDurationMs": 6090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Manifold's idea is to treat all\nour pool of GPUs as one pool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155210,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do priority-based\ndeployments of workloads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158510,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to understand the topologies\nof AI-based inference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161120,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and training workloads\nto most efficiently use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164060,
    "dDurationMs": 1425,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that GPU capacity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165497,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to also abstract\nthe underlying hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167750,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that\nit supports ASICS,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169310,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it supports GPUs,\nFPGAs, and even CPUs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173150,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And more and more, we\nhave models that consist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176330,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of CPU portions of the model\nand GPU portions of the model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180920,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including models that actually\nhave mini models inside of them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1185300,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like they might have an\nembedding model within them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188660,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They might have a visual\nlarge language model embedded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192920,
    "dDurationMs": 2632,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "within them, if they're\na multimodal model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195577,
    "dDurationMs": 3453,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so these topologies\nare getting more complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199030,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what we want to\ndo is bring this power"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202240,
    "dDurationMs": 6730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Azure container instances\nin this isolation to workloads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208970,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like this on top of\ndirect virtualization,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210980,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we can put CPU\ncontainers inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213770,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of its own Hyper-V\nisolated container"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217250,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the AI model\ncomponents, those containers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221235,
    "dDurationMs": 2216,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in their own separate ones\ntoo, so they don't interfere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223476,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with each other, and\nthey get direct access"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226270,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to hardware at the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227770,
    "dDurationMs": 4930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is a benefit of direct\nvirtualization is we can assign"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232700,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the GPU to a virtual machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234680,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That virtual machine can then\ncreate a sub-virtual machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237890,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of these L2s, and then\ngive the GPUs that it's got"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241850,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over to that container."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244220,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then it has direct\naccess to that hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247160,
    "dDurationMs": 5410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me show you\nthis demo of Manifold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255670,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what we're going to\nsee here is if I get the nodes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258580,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this cluster, we're going\nto go take a look at one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262420,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of those nodes and get\nthe pods in the node."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265430,
    "dDurationMs": 6923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's one pod in there,\nwhich is Llama 4 server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272378,
    "dDurationMs": 2082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's another one,\nwhich is a metrics server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274460,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of them is a GPU-based\none, one is a CPU-based one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277790,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we go take a look inside\nthe pod that's got the GPU,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281240,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Llama model in\nit, you can see it's got"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283125,
    "dDurationMs": 1885,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the GPUs visible to it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285010,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's got a whole bunch\nof RAM visible to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287530,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's got a whole bunch\nof processors assigned to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290785,
    "dDurationMs": 3405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see the Nvidia\nSMI command shows us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294190,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it actually has those\nGPUs available to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296980,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we go take a look at the\nCPU pod sitting right next to it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300250,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the same server, you can see\nthat it's got almost no memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1304030,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's only got two processors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305890,
    "dDurationMs": 2896,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's got no\nGPUs attached to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308811,
    "dDurationMs": 1379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just to prove\nto you it works,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310190,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're going to go take a look\nat this cat video and send this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312650,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for inference to that GPU pod\nsitting there with direct access"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317330,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to GPUs, the Llama 4\nMaverick model there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321680,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then successfully\ndo an inference there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326150,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The point being proven here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1328340,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we've got CPU pods\ncompletely isolated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330830,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from GPU pods directly attached\nto the physical server hardware"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336020,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because of direct\nvirtualization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339520,
    "dDurationMs": 5108,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Applause ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344653,
    "dDurationMs": 2227,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we're also not just\noptimizing the compute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346880,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're also optimizing the way\nthat inference works in terms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350660,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of KV caches, which is --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353090,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the KV cache is effectively\nthe state of the LLM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357890,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can't do\ndecoding efficiently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1361220,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without having a KV cache\nwhich represents the processing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364820,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of all the previous\ntokens in the prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368030,
    "dDurationMs": 3698,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you interact with an LLM,\nyou do so typically using turns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371753,
    "dDurationMs": 1347,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so you might have Turn 1,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373100,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you just have\na system prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1374780,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say you're doing a PR diff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376610,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you're\ndoing development."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1378380,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you engage in an interaction\nwith Copilot on that PR diff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384380,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what that means is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385730,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you're extending\nthe prompt effectively,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389330,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your specific prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391310,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In an ideal case, you don't just\nwant to cache the system prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394010,
    "dDurationMs": 1972,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is what a\nlot of AI frameworks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395994,
    "dDurationMs": 1406,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let you do is they say, hey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1397400,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cache this for me, and\nthen I'm not going to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399710,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pay the cost for decoding\nthis again or prefilling it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403790,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what you really want is\nthe whole thing to be cached,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406760,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that if your workload moves,\nyour inference moves from one GP"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410300,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to another, one\nserver to another,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412070,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you're not\nrepaying this price."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415100,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we can only do\nthis if we've got a cache"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418970,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sits all the way\nbehind all of the servers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422810,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is something\nthat we've got coming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424460,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out in preview now called\nAzure Context Cache."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426710,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea here is that Azure\nContext Cache, behind it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430670,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has a storage account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432260,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that storage account is\nwhere we're caching the KV state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436790,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for all of the\ninference requests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438860,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So regardless of what\nserver they go to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441500,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the prompt is not there, the\nKV isn't there, we can look it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446690,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up in the cache and fetch it\nin and not have to decode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449390,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that again, saving\ntime and money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453410,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's go take a look at that\nAzure Context Cache in action."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459620,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here, we're sending,\nconcurrency level one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464420,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're sending a bunch\nof queries into the system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467360,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all with the same system prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468650,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see that we\nhad all of those cached."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471140,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The cache hit rate was 81%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473360,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because after the first\nrequest goes to the server,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475984,
    "dDurationMs": 1696,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next one is\nlikely gonna have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477680,
    "dDurationMs": 2056,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that system prompt\nalready cached in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479761,
    "dDurationMs": 2239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we do a concurrency\nlevel of 10, they're going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482000,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get sprayed across servers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483797,
    "dDurationMs": 1628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and our cache hit\nrate actually goes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485450,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down because now sometimes\na request is landing on a server"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487970,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without the system prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1490070,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a lot of systems have you\nset this cache key unique to try"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1493220,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pin a conversation on a\nparticular server, an endpoint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497720,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The hit rate\nactually drops there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499310,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because every\nconversation gets mapped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501770,
    "dDurationMs": 2316,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a different\nserver intentionally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504111,
    "dDurationMs": 2309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the system prompt might\nnot have already shown up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506420,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the first hit\nthere is always --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508430,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first query there is\nalways going to be a miss."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510980,
    "dDurationMs": 5310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we set\nthe prompt cache,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1516290,
    "dDurationMs": 2181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see that the\nprompt cache rate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1518483,
    "dDurationMs": 2517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hit rate is going to go up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where did the demo go here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523400,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Went up to 96% with\nthe remote cache here;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1526280,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "96.2% is the hit rate here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528710,
    "dDurationMs": 5430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's because no matter\nwhich server the query lands on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534140,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the prompt is -- the KV cache\nfor that prompt is going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1537560,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be fetched from remote\ncache if it wasn't there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540740,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So transparently,\nbehind the scenes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542900,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this prompt cache using Azure\nstorage to go and spread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545810,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out the KV cache\nacross the servers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548300,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "effectively making the servers\nhave a pool cache rather"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552080,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than individual server-based\ncaches, which is going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555050,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to improve hit rate, which\nis going to save money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1557210,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you're not having\nto pay for the prefill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560240,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on those system caches\nevery time you have a miss."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563780,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564950,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's take a look at\nthe next cool innovation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568790,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I've got a -- it's\nlike an ACI-themed talk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1571520,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because this is one of the\ncool things about ACI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1575210,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you talk about\ncontainers, you're talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1577370,
    "dDurationMs": 2029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about layers and images."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1579424,
    "dDurationMs": 2057,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you talk about virtual\nmachines, you're talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581506,
    "dDurationMs": 3244,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about full-blown\nvirtual machine images."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584750,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, when you talk\nabout container sandboxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587450,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're typically talking about\nsomething that is very bespoke,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591110,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of a custom image, and\nit's very small and lightweight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594380,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is what you\nwant to be extremely fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1597140,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now one of the ways\nto get a fast startup"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1600560,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a container image, which you\nwant with these for these agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1603800,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be able to say, \"I'm going\nto go write a Python script"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1606350,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and run it, I'm going to\ngo create a little HTML site"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1609290,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and iterate on it,\" is you\nwant the startup to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1613310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "close to instantaneous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615590,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it comes to containers,\nyou can get startup times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617990,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the five, 20-second range,\ndepending on what the OS is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622370,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we want literally thousands\nof these things to be able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1627140,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to start simultaneously\nand to start very quickly off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630050,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the same base image."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1631550,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way we do that is\nwith memory snapshotting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1634040,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we actually start the\ncontainer, snapshot its memory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637940,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then if you get a\nrequest for the same container,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640340,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we simply map the memory, and\nwe skip all the initialization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643730,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and map it right into a\nrunning container box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646970,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me show you one of, I\nthink, my favorite demo of this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1650090,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is, how would you\nlike to see 10,000 container"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655970,
    "dDurationMs": 1916,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sandboxes launch?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659540,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, because if\nthe answer is yes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1662720,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's the rest of the session.\n[ Laughter ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664580,
    "dDurationMs": 2046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm just kidding,\nno, I'm just kidding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666651,
    "dDurationMs": 1559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I'm going to show you is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668210,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can do this\nincredibly quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671630,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've got 10 workers\nlaunching 1,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673760,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these container\nsandboxes each."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676970,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've got a little animation\nto show you the progress"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1680990,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of those launches here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682730,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here we go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1683930,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Create 10 worker pods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690650,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692960,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So each one is\ngoing to add 1,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695270,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This represents 1,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697460,
    "dDurationMs": 1416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see them launching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700705,
    "dDurationMs": 2671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few down here left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703400,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boom, done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705170,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10,000 container sandboxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709460,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Applause ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711840,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Average container sandbox\nlaunch time, two seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717140,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So not just speed, but\nscale at the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1720410,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is, like I said, one\nof the really cool demos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723380,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so you're going to see the\nagent sandboxing land on top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728780,
    "dDurationMs": 2146,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Azure Container Instance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730951,
    "dDurationMs": 1157,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1732133,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's go into our last\nsection now and talk about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734510,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or second to last section,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735920,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and talk a little\nbit about security."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738410,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of the\nexciting things for me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740810,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about security is the evolution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744440,
    "dDurationMs": 2383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of something called\nconfidential computing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1746848,
    "dDurationMs": 2332,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many people have heard\nof confidential computing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749180,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, quite a few of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1750530,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For those of you that haven't\nheard of confidential computing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1754070,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the easiest way to think\nabout it is in the context"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756320,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of how your data gets protected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758570,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for a long time now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1761810,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everybody encrypts\ntheir network traffic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766220,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the last 20 years or\nso, it went from every now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770180,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you'd run\ninto a site with SSL."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772070,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now every single site,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774080,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single network connection\nhas to have TLS on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777800,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, the other part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1779090,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of protecting is\nwhile it's at rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782210,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is where\nit's stored on disk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784580,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to have\nthat encrypted, too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786080,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if the storage gets accessed\noutside of the protection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1790580,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the logical protections\nof the workload on top of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793160,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the data is useless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795170,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we not only\nhave now in cloud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797570,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We started with node\ndata encryption at rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1799694,
    "dDurationMs": 1776,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now we've got\nserver-side encryption."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801470,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We also have customer\nmanaged key,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802746,
    "dDurationMs": 1145,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you can bring\nyour own encryption"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1803916,
    "dDurationMs": 2059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and have double layered\nencryption of data at rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1806000,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what's been missing largely\nis protecting the data while"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809060,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's in use, because when\nthat data gets decrypted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1812450,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the server or pulled off the\ndisk in clear text, it's sitting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816620,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in there on the server, maybe\ninside of a virtual machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819890,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but still in the\nserver environment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1822860,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what can access that\ndata includes everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1825380,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the hypervisor to the\nadmins to the host software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828710,
    "dDurationMs": 5430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a malicious hacker that might\npenetrate the infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1834140,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of those can get access."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836000,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even in your\nown applications,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838310,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you want to keep maybe your own\noperators away from that data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842810,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and only have the compute\nthat needs to have access"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845570,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to that data have\naccess to that data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848030,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is confidential computing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1849380,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now one aspect of\nconfidential computing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851750,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is not just this\nprotection of that data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1855200,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a hardware enclave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857000,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where none of those\nthings can get inside of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860030,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the hardware also\ncan measure what's inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1863270,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the enclave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1864380,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that measurement\nis called an attestation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1866720,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And some code inside that\nenclave can ask the hardware"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1870560,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a quote, which\nis the attestation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872810,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "present it to a relying party,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874790,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is typically a\nkey management service"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877220,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that has a policy on it that\nsays only release this key"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881570,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to an enclave of\nthis hardware type"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884420,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the security\nversion number on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886220,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with this configuration of code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889250,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at that point,\nthe key gets released."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891380,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's encrypted to the enclave,\nthe code in the enclave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894590,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The code in the enclave decrypts\nthe key and then can start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897440,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to process the data in the\nclear, and everybody knows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1900800,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it's being protected\nwith that hardware isolation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1903890,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is confidential computing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905630,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've been working on enabling\nconfidential computing in Azure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1910430,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for over a decade, starting\nwith Intel SGX servers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914240,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the data center, and now\nvirtual machines from AMD"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918530,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Intel in the data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920570,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And our portfolio is the largest\nof any hyperscaler when it comes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923630,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to confidential\ncomputing services,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925550,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "confidential computing\ncontainer offerings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1927890,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like confidential\ncontainers on ACI,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930350,
    "dDurationMs": 3403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well as the hardware\ninfrastructure underneath it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1936080,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I talked before\nabout live migration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1938270,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And live migration is one of\nthose things that allows us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941900,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to run the fleet efficiently,\nbecause we can move workloads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1945350,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around to reduce fragmentation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948530,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can also make customer\nworkloads more reliable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951470,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we can move them if we\nsee a server is going to fail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954200,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can also move\nthem around if we need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956480,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to service a host in\nan impactful way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958760,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that means that the\ncustomer's workload is not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961640,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as impacted by that\nservicing operation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1964610,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a fundamental requirement\nof a hyperscale cloud"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1967940,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to have live migration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1970010,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this has unfortunately\nbeen one of the missing gaps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1973370,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in confidential\ncomputing offerings is lack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1975800,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of live migration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977390,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we've been working\ndeeply with Intel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981110,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on confidential live migration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983930,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the way that works is you\nhave a confidential virtual"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1986240,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "machine here on one server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988040,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've got something\ncalled a migration TD,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1992540,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is a partition,\neffectively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1994850,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think of it as a confidential\npartition that is also measured"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1998990,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as part of the virtual\nmachine's measurement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2001060,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that the receiving side has\na policy and the sending side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2004570,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a policy that says I will\nonly migrate the contents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2007600,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of this virtual machine to\nanother server with the MigTD"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2012010,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is approved for\nthis virtual machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2015430,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so effectively extending the\nconfidential trust boundary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019060,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between two servers, adhering\nto policy that is being enforced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025060,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the confidential\ncomputing hardware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2026860,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to show you for the\nfirst time ever a confidential"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2030070,
    "dDurationMs": 2323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "virtual machine\nbeing live migrated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2032418,
    "dDurationMs": 1372,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from one server to another."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2033790,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the first time ever\nthis has been shown publicly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2040090,
    "dDurationMs": 1924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here, we have\none server here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2042039,
    "dDurationMs": 2576,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hyper-V manager, you can see, a\nlot of you are familiar with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044640,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's our CVM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2046030,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's the other server\nmanager on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049300,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see no\nvirtual machines there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051220,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see there's our MigTD"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2052650,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we have in\nthis virtual machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2054100,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here we're looking\nat the output of RDP"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059440,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into that virtual\nmachine on Server 1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2061810,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see it's\npinging every second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063790,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's typical in a\nlive migration demo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2065950,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we started migrating\nthis virtual machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2068070,
    "dDurationMs": 1685,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see this is\ngoing to take a while,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2069767,
    "dDurationMs": 1748,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we're going to\nspeed it up a little bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2071540,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because this is a\nlarge virtual machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073475,
    "dDurationMs": 3155,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a few gigabytes of RAM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2076630,
    "dDurationMs": 2963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see the TD\ninfo attestations that are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2079618,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happening that\nwe've got printed out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2081103,
    "dDurationMs": 2997,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then boom,\nthe CVM just moved,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084100,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's on the other\nside, which is why we saw"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2086200,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that RDP connection die, because\nit's connected to the IP address"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2091140,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on that first machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2092550,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that right there,\nfirst time ever, and it's not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2096100,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in production yet,\nbut you can see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2098650,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we just literally achieved\nthis in the last few weeks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2101620,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first confidential virtual\nmachine line migration anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2105520,
    "dDurationMs": 4913,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Applause ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110458,
    "dDurationMs": 2172,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the next thing I'm going\nto show you is something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112630,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I also think\nis really, really cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2116530,
    "dDurationMs": 3023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is something else\nthat Microsoft has pioneered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2119578,
    "dDurationMs": 1897,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've been working on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2121500,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware-based roots\nof trust for a while."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2124455,
    "dDurationMs": 1795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've got something called\nCaliptra that we donated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2126250,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the OpenCUBE project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2127810,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is our root of trust that we\ndeploy in every single server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2131800,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I was working\nwith the architects,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2136390,
    "dDurationMs": 2303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hardware security\narchitects in Azure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2138718,
    "dDurationMs": 2575,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and thinking, you\nknow what we're missing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2141305,
    "dDurationMs": 2015,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not just a root of trust,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2143320,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we need key management\ninside of our hardware"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2147880,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we put into every server,\nbecause what that will allow us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2151120,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do is keep keys protected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2154210,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with hardware throughout\ntheir whole life cycle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156700,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never have them exit the\nhardware trust boundary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2161500,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we developed something\ninternally called MANA Corp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2165490,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Publicly, we announced\nit late last year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2168430,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as Azure Integrated HSM, because\nit's effectively an HSM sitting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2174390,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there inside of\nevery single server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2176370,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've been\ndeploying these now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2178620,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into every single\nserver in Azure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2181570,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What this allows is\na key to be released"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2185740,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with policy from an actual HSM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2189880,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like Azure-managed HSM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191350,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or Azure Key Vault\ncan have a policy on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2194560,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will release the keys\ninto Azure Integrated HSMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2199510,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Azure Integrated HSMs\nare FIPS 140 Level 3,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2203700,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "FIPS 140-3, level\n3, certified just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2206670,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the HSMs behind Manage\nHSM and Azure Key Vault."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2211080,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that means that\nthe key remains inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2214200,
    "dDurationMs": 6070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a FIPS 140-3 Level 3 boundary\nfrom the HSM to the server."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2220270,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then it can be accessed\nfor operations directly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2222880,
    "dDurationMs": 2353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from that virtual machine,\nbecause we map it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2225258,
    "dDurationMs": 2625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that hardware, into\nthe virtual machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2229350,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's go see a demo of that\nand the benefits that you get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2231960,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of that, using a simple\nscenario, which is I want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2236310,
    "dDurationMs": 7630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to sign a bunch of\npayloads using my AKV key."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2243940,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I've got here is a\npolicy that allows that key"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2248290,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be transported into\nAzure Integrated HSM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2251380,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I'm going to do\nfirst is sign 5,000 times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2254680,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over 32 threads a\npayload using Azure AKV,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2259510,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the key never\nexits the HSM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2262435,
    "dDurationMs": 2355,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see because we're\nsending all these operations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264790,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the HSM, we get about\n640 operations per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2269530,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we release that key into\nthe local Azure integrated HSM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2273910,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can perform those\noperations directly on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2276220,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see that\nour throughput went"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2278170,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 18,800 signing\noperations per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2282450,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we lost no\nsecurity in the process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2286510,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so this is the future\nof data center infrastructure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2291460,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and security for keys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2293230,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The future we're moving to is\none with confidential computing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2296800,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where keys, and that's\ngoing to end up being keys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2299500,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for everything, keys for\nany of these services,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2303450,
    "dDurationMs": 2496,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including the services\nthat agents are talking to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2305971,
    "dDurationMs": 1259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are going to be protected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307230,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with hardware throughout\ntheir entire life cycle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2309300,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that it can never be stolen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2311550,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's a very\nexciting future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2313520,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Applause ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2318905,
    "dDurationMs": 1085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319990,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've got one last\nthing to show,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2322210,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is very experimental."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2324250,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I like to end with, hey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2326200,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is where we're\nlooking speculatively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2328540,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Microsoft Research\nwork that is happening,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2331690,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "may or may not be\never productized,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2334840,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it looks really promising,\nand it really would be huge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2339010,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if we were able to\nmake this happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2341260,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the idea here is\nthat if you take a look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2343870,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at network communications,\nnetworking inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2349000,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a data center, it's\ntypically been over copper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2351910,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the problem with\ncopper, it's very lightweight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2354220,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's very cheap,\nit's very reliable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2356110,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the maximum distances\nyou can talk to over copper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360910,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without loss is about 2 meters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364630,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, of course, 2 meters\nis not much distance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2367245,
    "dDurationMs": 1876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the data center,\nyou really want to connect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2369146,
    "dDurationMs": 2264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially if you move\ntowards disaggregated devices"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371410,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and computing, where\nyou want GPUs over here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373390,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you want servers over here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2375850,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that you want\na very high speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378580,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high bandwidth interconnect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2381340,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's typically not copper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2382990,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what a lot of people\nare moving towards is optics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2386320,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and optics with lasers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2387640,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem with lasers is that\nthey're very high powered,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2390820,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they generate a lot of heat,\nwhich makes them very expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2395140,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what we've been exploring is\nsomething called Project Mosaic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2401860,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now one of the things\nwith this mechanism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2404440,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I just showed you is\nthat there's lots of fiber --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2407590,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's just a few fibers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2408760,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're all very high\nbandwidth and high speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2411760,
    "dDurationMs": 5550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we're trying is using many\nchannels operating at low speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2417310,
    "dDurationMs": 5010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using standard LED technology,\nmicro LEDs, the kind of LEDs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2422320,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are being\nproductized right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2424840,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for next generation VR\nglasses, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2428800,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goggles, as well as cameras."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2431740,
    "dDurationMs": 7580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These things -- projecting those\nLED lights over fibers inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2439320,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a cable and then\nhaving them read"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2441000,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with standard silicon\ncamera sensor arrays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2443890,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the beauty of\nthis approach is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2446350,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that these are basically\ncommercial technologies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2449140,
    "dDurationMs": 4216,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are scaling because of\nother economic factors outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2453381,
    "dDurationMs": 1939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what we want to take\nadvantage of it for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2455320,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we can kind of ride on\nthe back of this technology,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2458020,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but deploy it in\nour data centers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2459820,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm going to show you\nfor the first time ever,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2461800,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a live feed from our\nMicrosoft Research Cambridge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2465310,
    "dDurationMs": 6210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lab, transmission over\none of these LED cables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2471520,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's go and switch here..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2477583,
    "dDurationMs": 1797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Microsoft Cambridge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2479380,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Katar, good to see you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2482195,
    "dDurationMs": 1628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Katar: Hello, Mark,\ngood to see you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2483848,
    "dDurationMs": 1922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, everyone,\nactually, I'm Katar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2485770,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm from Microsoft\nResearch, Cambridge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2488140,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm here in the lab, holding one\nof those cables with micro IDs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2493260,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I wanted to show\nyou exactly is what is inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2497100,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how this is being tested\nin the lab before it goes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2500760,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into Microsoft data centers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2502930,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you open this up, this\nis what we're going to see:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2507280,
    "dDurationMs": 5670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a small PCB with the yellow area\nhere, which we call the package."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2512950,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on top of that\nwe have a tiny array"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2515980,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of micro-LEDs and\nphoto detectors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2518980,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And underneath, we have the CMOS\nchip that controls everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2524620,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, this small\nPCB is being tested here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2527650,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the lab using the\nevaluation board,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2530350,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the big PCB that we see there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2532450,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the green light coming up is\nactually coming from hundreds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2536830,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of micro-LEDs and coupled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2539110,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to this imaging fiber\nusing this optical coupler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2543610,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, after tens of\nmeters of transmission"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2547570,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over this imaging fiber, here\nwe are at the receiver side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2552280,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the screen here shows\nthe output process of the fiber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2557500,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, this\nfiber itself has more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2560440,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than thousands of pores."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2562210,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And each of these micro-LEDs\nactually is coupled to more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2565720,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than one pore, which makes\nthe alignment much more easier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2570580,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, actually, in a\nreal operation mode,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2574180,
    "dDurationMs": 5310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all this micro-LED will be armed\nand flashing at high speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2579490,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billion times per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2581320,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the human eye will not\nbe able to distinguish this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2585460,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So basically, to make it\nconcrete, and to show you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2587920,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can individually control\neach of these micro-LEDS,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2591400,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to ask Mark to pick\nany letter or a number from zero"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2597760,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to nine, and I can\ndisplay it to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2599718,
    "dDurationMs": 1295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark Russinovich:\nOkay, awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2601038,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This kind of proves that\nit's live -- how about a letter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2603173,
    "dDurationMs": 1661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody shout out a letter\nthat we want to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2604859,
    "dDurationMs": 1151,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Z?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2606010,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Z, all right, let's do Z."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2608359,
    "dDurationMs": 2504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Katar:\nZ, Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2612250,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so here, you can see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2613660,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we are switching off\nsome of the micro-LEDs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2617020,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And each of these flowers\nhere are one micro-LED"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2621850,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can be modulated\nas gigabit per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2625270,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's wait for\nthe letter Z to show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2631963,
    "dDurationMs": 1343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2635289,
    "dDurationMs": 1207,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark Russinovich:\nZ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2636520,
    "dDurationMs": 3153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Applause ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2639698,
    "dDurationMs": 1846,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Katar: Hope you\nenjoyed this short demo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2641569,
    "dDurationMs": 1764,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm going to hand\nit back to you, Mark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2643358,
    "dDurationMs": 1412,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark Russinovich: All right,\nthanks, that was awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2644770,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks, Katar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2645850,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Speaker 1: Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2648633,
    "dDurationMs": 2036,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark Russinovich: Okay,\nwell, that brings us to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2650681,
    "dDurationMs": 3059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "conclusion of the session."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2653740,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I hope you saw was\na lot of innovation happening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2657010,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at all layers of the stack, from\nthe hardware to the data centers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2660040,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the serverless offerings,\nto GPUs, prompt prefetching,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2664060,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inference, and then\na look at the future"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2666670,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and where we might be going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2668440,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with networking\ninside the data center."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2671590,
    "dDurationMs": 2543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you like this, please\nfill out an evaluation form. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2674158,
    "dDurationMs": 1053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2675236,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you didn't, you can\ngo ahead and skip that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2677230,
    "dDurationMs": 3556,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Laughter ]\nI hope you have a great Build,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2680811,
    "dDurationMs": 1987,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I hope to see you\nthis afternoon with Scott."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2682823,
    "dDurationMs": 2237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to have a fun\nsession on the future"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2685060,
    "dDurationMs": 1826,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of software engineering,\nso I'll see you then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2686910,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Applause ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2688584,
    "dDurationMs": 4175,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ Music ]"
    } ]
  } ]
}
